### 8.2 Interaction Patterns

| User Action | System Response |
|:---|:---|
| Click **INIT** | Fetches all 28 exchanges, builds graph, enables SCAN |
| Click **SCAN** | Runs triangular + Bellman‑Ford, populates opportunity lists |
| Click **PULL LEVER** | Re-initializes, scans, selects top paylines, animates graph |
| Click **EXECUTE ALL** | Executes all highlighted paylines, updates bankroll, syncs swarm |
| Click opportunity card | Opens trade modal with rate breakdown and execution button |
| Toggle **LIVE** | Switches between paper trading and wallet proxy execution |
| Change **Handle** | Updates local display and syncs to Yjs swarm |
| Click **🌐 GRAPH** | Shows/hides force-directed graph canvas |
| Click **☁️ IPNS** | Opens IPNS/Share panel with QR code and deployment URL |
| Click **START DIRECT SHARE** | Generates P2P QR code for direct app transfer |
| Click **📦 TORRENT** | Opens torrent panel for historical data download |
| Click **📊 DB** | Opens DuckDB query interface |
| Click **💱 DEX** | Opens internal DEX order book |
| Click **⚡ MANA** | Displays contribution metrics |

### 8.3 Audio Feedback

The platform uses the Web Audio API (`AudioContext`) for gamified feedback:

| Event | Audio Cue |
|:---|:---|
| Pull Lever | Sawtooth wave, 800Hz, 80ms |
| Win/Trade Success | Ascending triad (C5→E5→G5) |
| Particle burst | Visual confetti (no audio) |

**Documentation References:**
- [MDN Web Audio API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Audio_API)
- [MDN AudioContext](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/AudioContext)

