## 11. Technical Debt Assessment & Roadmap

### 11.1 Current Technical Debt

| Item | Severity | Remediation |
|:---|:---|:---|
| Monolithic HTML file (~2800 lines) | Medium | Modularize into ES modules with build step |
| Manual force layout algorithm | Low | Could integrate d3-force for better layouts |
| No order matching in DEX | High | Implement matching engine on volunteer peers |
| DuckDB-Wasm bundle size (~30MB) | Medium | Lazy load only when DB panel opened |
| Hard-coded IPNS key | Low | Make configurable via environment |
| No encryption for private rooms | Medium | Implement Web Crypto API for room keys |
| Proxy dependency for non-CORS exchanges | Medium | Explore GossipSub relay for P2P data sharing |
| No automated testing | High | Add unit tests for graph algorithms, parsers |

### 11.2 Roadmap – v24.0 Target

| Feature | Priority | Dependencies |
|:---|:---|:---|
| GossipSub real-time market feed | Critical | libp2p-js integration |
| DEX order matching engine | High | Yjs document observer |
| Encrypted strategy rooms | High | Web Crypto API |
| On-chain mana attestation | Medium | Ethereum provider integration |
| d3-force graph layout | Low | d3.js CDN |
| ES module refactor | Medium | Build tooling (Vite/esbuild) |
| Mobile PWA support | Medium | Service worker, manifest.json |
| Uniswap V3 direct subgraph queries | Medium | The Graph API integration |

